{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122, the massive free-to-play combat arena. Experience thrilling modes &amp; new gameplay features in Verdansk and Rebirth Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Downtown Verdansk Transforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The massive transformation of Downtown Verdansk begins at The Overlook, the sprawling skyscraper at its center. Whether you walk in through the lobby and shut it behind you, zipline directly into the tower, or come in via cranes at the roof, action awaits at every floor of the skyscraper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fan-favorite Resurgence Map Rebirth Island is also ready for players to drop into with its fast paced engagements, underground caves, waterways, and varying vantage points that provide exciting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a new locale to dominate foes in Verdansk, make sure to jump into the action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Loot For Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover supply boxes and complete contracts to build your arsenal and gain a tactical advantage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1962663?t=1748534520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/0fc41bf8af50953c5d3784fb4acbe5c65acc0f83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748534520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748534520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962663/84a5d6150e49013a9b30c62d87cb5df602e2ef26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748534520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"descri